Prisma schema lives in `{{#if (hasPackage "db")}}packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma{{else}}prisma/schema.prisma{{/if}}`. After editing it, run `{{runScript "db:push"}}` to sync and `{{runScript "db:generate"}}` to regenerate the client. Inspect data with `{{runScript "db:studio"}}`.

The client is generated into `generated/prisma`, which is not committed. `{{runScript "db:generate"}}` runs before `dev` and `build` ({{#if (isMono)}}Turborepo `dependsOn` on `^db:generate`{{else}}the `predev` and `prebuild` scripts{{/if}}) and needs `DATABASE_URL` in `.env`. Run it by hand after a schema edit while `dev` is running.

`{{runScript "db:migrate"}}` (`prisma migrate dev`) asks for a migration name, so run it from a terminal.
